# ==============================================================================
# Email Configuration (Brevo HTTPS API & Fallbacks)
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT FOR RAILWAY / RENDER DEPLOYMENTS:
# Railway blocks outbound raw SMTP traffic (ports 25, 465, 587) to prevent spam.
# To send emails reliably on Railway, use an HTTPS API (Port 443 - never blocked):
#
# Option 1: Brevo HTTPS API (Recommended — 300 free emails/day over Port 443)
# 1. Sign up free at https://www.brevo.com
# 2. Go to: Profile (Top Right) -> SMTP & API -> API Keys -> Generate a new API key
# 3. Add to Railway Variables (and .env):
BREVO_API_KEY=""
BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL="mdkabirulhossainj@gmail.com"
BREVO_SENDER_NAME="Luxe E-Commerce"
# Note: BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL must be your verified email in Brevo.
#
# Option 2: Resend HTTPS API (Alternative — 3,000 free emails/month)
RESEND_API_KEY=""
RESEND_FROM="Luxe E-Commerce <onboarding@resend.dev>"
#
# Option 3: Gmail SMTP (For Local Development only)
SMTP_HOST="smtp.gmail.com"
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER="mdkabirulhossainj@gmail.com"
SMTP_PASS="your-16-char-app-password"
SMTP_SECURE="true"
SMTP_FROM='"Luxe E-Commerce" <mdkabirulhossainj@gmail.com>'


